Serve only the regular file opened for the response.

Open the path without blocking on a pipe writer, validate the opened file,
and stream the same descriptor so a replaced path cannot switch the response
to a device or pipe. Close the descriptor after cached responses, errors and
client disconnects as well as successful transfers.

